.Dd November 24, 2026
.Dt HMKTVM-PICKY 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm hmktvm-picky
.Nd one tighter auction search for a virtual-machine host
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm hmktvm-picky
.Op Ar hcli-flags ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is a
.Xr sh 1
wrapper.
It prints one label and calls
.Pa ~/bin/hcli
once with
.Fl p Cm market .
.Ev HCLI
overrides that path.
Extra arguments are appended.
.Pp
The search is
.Fl M Cm 64 ,
.Fl o Cm disk.count.min=2 ,
.Fl o Cm disk.min=8000 ,
.Fl o Cm price.max=35 ,
.Fl o Cm format=price ,
.Fl o Cm re=ECC ,
and
.Fl o Cm re=ENT .
The label is
.Dq 2disk 8gb storage <=$35 >=64G ram .
The label says dollars.
.Cm price.max
is the monthly price in euros.
8000 is total gigabytes.
Both patterns must match.
.Sh EXIT STATUS
The exit status is the status of
.Xr hcli 1 .
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr hcli 1 ,
.Xr hmktvm 1
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Todd T. Fries Aq Mt todd@fries.net
